Mode [drop-down list] - Display
Select the Operating Mode of the Display: Sample or Watch.
 
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Sample mode updates the display with the frequency you type into the text box Interval.
• Watch mode updates the displayed value each and every time the value changes. If the path and the
value you typed in is not watchable, Plant Simulation does not update the display.
The column Watchable in the window Show Attributes and Methods shows which attributes and
read-only attributes Plant Simulation can watch.
